sequenceDiagram
    title Tracker port and beads adapter — level 2: a slice lands, a second clone sees it

    actor Engineer
    participant a as implement session (clone A)
    participant porta as tracker.py + port + beads adapter, clone A
    participant bda as bd, clone A
    participant remote as Dolt-in-git (proposed, refs/dolt/data)
    participant portb as tracker.py + port + beads adapter, clone B
    participant bdb as bd, clone B
    participant b as fresh session (clone B)
    participant gh as GitHub

    a->>porta: tracker.py next-ready --kind slice
    porta->>bda: bd ready, filtered on cb.kind
    bda-->>a: slice n is next
    a->>porta: tracker.py claim-slice (github login)
    porta->>bda: bd update slice --status in_progress, set assignee
    porta->>bda: read the assignee back (atomic_claim is false)
    a->>porta: tracker.py record-attempt (score, attempts+1)
    a->>porta: tracker.py set-slice-state closed
    porta->>bda: bd close slice --reason "ends_with verified"
    bda-->>a: slice n+1 unblocked
    a->>porta: tracker.py sync
    porta->>bda: bd sync
    bda->>remote: push the tracker
    b->>portb: tracker.py sync
    portb->>bdb: bd sync
    remote-->>bdb: pull the tracker
    b->>portb: tracker.py next-ready --kind slice
    portb->>bdb: bd ready
    bdb-->>b: slice n+1 is next, with no file read
    a->>gh: open pull request
    a->>porta: tracker.py open-pull-request (ref, epic ids)
    porta->>bda: bd create "PR n" -t task, then bd dep add for each epic
    Engineer->>gh: merge the pull request
    Engineer->>porta: human close: tracker.py set-pull-request-state merged
    porta->>bda: bd close pr --reason merged
    bda-->>a: held epics unblocked
    a->>porta: tracker.py set-epic-state merged, for each epic
